# S5 contract 3.7 (R-C9a): a GTD BUY LIMIT resting as leg 101 expires at its deadline: the sweep mints exactly
# one CANCEL dispatch; ten more sweeps after the deadline mint nothing; the ME terminal CANCELLED on the leg
# surfaces as EXPIRED (EXPIRY_REQUESTED) and releases the hold; a sweep after that pops nothing.
CLOCK 1700000000000
